Heroes! You’ve been conquering hostile lands for the last couple of months. Meanwhile, villainous separatists had been preparing a riot to depose wise lords of Pangea world. It's time to stand against this menace!

✔ New game feature - "Riots"
"Riot" happens on held cells at a random moment between "Clashes". "Neutral forces" will attack these cells. The more cells guild is holding, The higher is the chance for "Riot". "Power" of the "Neutral forces" depends on the Tier of the room.

Dev's note: "Riots" should decrease the number of cases when one guild dominate on the map and give other guilds more opportunities

✔ "Turf War"
Rewards in all rooms were rebalanced;
Common cells in the first Tier room have only rare cards, Landmarks have only epic cards as a reward;

✔ Recruits' info shows the "Power" of the player now (was his League);

✔ Maximum amount of gold increased to 1 million (was 500k);

✔ New breathtaking map!

✔ Added new "Journey" chapter;

✔ "Pal points" can be bought in "Journey" and "Dark Tower" shops now;

✔ Friends' progress is shown on "Path of Hero".

