✔ Added "Guilds". It includes "Guild Creation", "Guild Rating", which will be counted depending on the summary Might of the guild members(but just at the first time, it will be changed with Guild Wars system release), "Guild Chat". Players are able to create communities based on guilds and prepare for Guild Wars.

Guilds have level system. Guild Master could upgrade guild for "Influence". "Influence" is a common guild currency that can be obtained for Guild Wars and for in-game purchases. Every guild member has personal guild currency "Contribution". It can be obtained from Guild Wars(the amount depends on personal participation of every guild member) and for in-game purchases. "Contribution" could be spent on the different items in Guild Shop(will be added later).

Before Guild Wars system is released we will organise contests on our Facebook Page where players could win "Influence" and upgrade their guilds.
