✔ "Grand Master" league is a new level in PVP ladder. It has 100 places. Players will be ranked according to their Match Making Rating based on Elo Rating System. At the end of the season top-50 players will stay in "Grand Master" league, other players will be moved to "Legendary" league, and 50 players from "Legendary" League will be moved to "Grand Master" league.

Top-100 players of "Legendary" league will be moved to "Grand Master" league on September 1.

✔ "Legendary" league could be lost now. Players with less than 11000 Fame will be moved to League 2.

