Guys, we are considering all feedbacks, suggestions and reviews.
There are many reviews saying Mighty Party is a p2w game. Most part of devs started the new game on Steam, and we were surprised to see many players with legendary cards on League 30-15. So we started checking out where did they get them, and the answer was very simple. You know that game was launched on a different platform before, Steam players don't have fresh ladder. The biggest part of that "unexpected" legendries were gotten as a season-end reward(Game was published on March 30th, Season was ended on March 31st). So at the end of the current season most of you will get legendary cards.

Most of you like "Journey" so we increased the number of attempts there and they are refreshing with rank-up now. Also we increased the number of common cards that can be obtained in "Journey" and this change plus "Evolve" feature opens the great opportunities in squad improvement.

✔ Matchmaking system assorts opponents from the same League Level. 
Dev's note: There was an issue where players get much stronger opponents. This was a real game breaking bug. It's fixed now and progress through the leagues will be much easier.

✔ Fixed an issue where fight against Warrior in "Journey" Chapter 3 doesn't work;

✔ Added new quests;

✔ Added full-screen mode (available in "Settings" menu);

